        {
          "ruleId": "model/Sponsor pre-endTime empty-raffle cancellation in enableRefunds can be front-run by a 1-USDC buyEntries transaction",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Raffle.enableRefunds allows the sponsor to cancel an active raffle before endTime only when totalEntries == 0. Because buyEntries is permissionless while block.timestamp < endTime, an observer in the public mempool can front-run the sponsor's enableRefunds() call with buyEntries(recipient, 1) for 1 USDC (1e6 quoteToken units). This increments totalEntries to 1, causing the sponsor's enableRefunds() transaction to take the totalEntries != 0 branch and revert with RefundsNotAvailable(endTime + 2 days, block.timestamp), locking the prize NFT until at least endTime (and winning the NFT for 1 USDC if reserveEntries == 1).\nAssumptions: The sponsor broadcasts enableRefunds() via a public mempool before endTime while totalEntries == 0."
          },
