        {
          "ruleId": "model/Untrusted prizeToken.safeTransferFrom in createRaffle activates the Raffle clone before RaffleCreated is emitted and before post-transfer ownerOf verification",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "In RaffleFactory.createRaffle, prize.safeTransferFrom(msg.sender, raffle, params.prizeTokenId) invokes Raffle.onERC721Received, which transitions the clone from Status.Initialized to Status.Active and emits PrizeDeposited before safeTransferFrom returns to RaffleFactory. Because Raffle's own ReentrancyGuard is not entered during createRaffle, a custom or hook-enabled prizeToken contract can call raffle.buyEntries(recipient, entryCount) inside safeTransferFrom after onERC721Received returns, emitting Transfer and TicketPurchased events before RaffleFactory verifies prize.ownerOf(params.prizeTokenId) == raffle and before RaffleCreated is emitted.\nAssumptions: The prizeToken contract executes an external call to the newly created Raffle clone inside safeTransferFrom after calling onERC721Received."
          },
